#: bb236414aecf4cc29565e2296b89b9c5
msgid "CLI interactive setup - You must go through each item and set the values to match your hardware"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:63
#: 31ad8f1b69aa4ade9ad88fd76e0b8773
msgid "\"setup\" menu:commands:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:65
#: f54c17194fd3433cadc056a6e67295e3
msgid "**erase**: When installing ACM for the first time, run this to erase bad values from EEPROM -- just in case!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:67
#: c0e8a868179947918867b0ce2a7b847c
msgid "**reset**: Performs factory reset and initialization of EEPROM values"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:68
#: 330dd9c705f0486d8d7a84e951add2c2
msgid "**radio**: Records the limits of ALL radio channels - very important!!!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:70
#: 909292feff3547438ed333c8601d15ee
msgid "**motors**: Interactive setup of your ESC and motors. Enter this mode, then plug-in battery, move your RC transmitter's pitch/roll sticks in each direction to make the prop in that direction spin (so moving the stick up will make the front rotor spin on a quad, and moving it right will make the right rotor spin). For copters with more than four motors, it will spin groups of motors, with the one closest to the direction of the stick going fastest."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:77
#: d0e1c2cd28304d629910691dd06d7909
msgid "**level**: Sets initial value of accelerometers - hold copter level"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:78
#: 586d0485903c4e6b9491b7f3c6153709
msgid "**modes**: Sets the flight modes assigned to each switch position (you have 5 available). Use your aileron/roll stick on your RC transmitter to scroll through the options. Full right moves forward through the list; full left moves back. Hit enter to save your settings and exit this mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:83
#: ea9cddcf7f40439db9601b55451a9744
msgid "**frame**: Sets your frame config: (x, +, v (Octo))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:84
#: 7e792c314d294e6b9ee80c1289e9ad27
msgid "**current**: Enables an AttoPilot current sensor: (on, off, milliamp hours)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:86
#: fdd00175e41044afac1a300d1b3598b7
msgid "**sonar**: Enable sonar sensor. Sensor hooks to the \"pitot\" port which is an analog input (on, off)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:88
#: 49cc46bb7f3748d7b2c8d9924a24f107
msgid "**compass**: Enables the compass (on, off)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:89
#: 7a9f05f114a640efa0407fe75e51b2d6
msgid "**declination**: Sets your local declination value -- lookup online for accuracy (decimal degrees)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/using-the-command-line-interpreter-to-configure-apmcopter.rst:91
#: ef6658e290c84629a452a2481af52f98
msgid "**show**: A formatted output of all the settings"
msgstr ""

